rd_stockRankingMark__Vt02e text-[20px] mb-3 font-semibold text-st-primary-text">#</span><span class="TrendingSymbolCard_stockRanking__AwXwm text-[30px] font-semibold text-st-primary-text">5</span></div></div><div class="TrendingSymbolCard_content__pp8ps text-st-secondary-text">Qualcomm is trending following a $60 billion multi-generation deal with Amazon to develop customized AI data center silicon and optical connectivity. While the partnership is viewed as a significant move toward diversifying away from mobile chips, the stock has faced downward pressure as some investors express frustration over its failure to maintain gains and skepticism regarding the timing of revenue realization.</div></a><a class="TrendingSymbolCard_container__ssk5I relative min-w-[240px] max-w-[240px] border border-primary-border p-4 rounded-2xl cursor-pointer hover|bg-light-grey-6-rgba-50 dark|hover|bg-dark-grey-5" href="/symbol/USO"><div class="flex-row justify-between items-center flex TrendingSymbolCard_header__ook4a w-full mb-3"><div class="flex-row justify-between items-center flex TrendingSymbolCard_stockInfo__lFIXd flex justify-start"><img src="https://logos.stocktwits-cdn.com/USO.png?w=72" alt="USO logo" class="TrendingSymbolCard_stockLogo__Pdbof w-7 h-7 mr-3 rounded-full"/><div class="flex-col justify-start items-start flex"><div class="flex-row justify-between items-center flex TrendingSymbolCard_stockSymbol__3TvGU flex items-center font-semibold text-st-primary-text"><span>USO</span></div><span class="TrendingSymbolCard_stockPrice__ESLZo text-[12px] font-semibold"><div class="flex-row justify-between items-end flex gap-1"><span class="text-st-primary-text" data-testid="trending-price-change">$146.51</span><span class="Change_positive__2H4d1 Change_container__GNa_f inline-flex gap-1 text-price-positive font-semibold" aria-label="Change"><div class="flex-row justify-between items-center flex gap-0.5"><span class="Change_arrow__AjLH9 relative flex items-center Change_positive__2H4